---
// Homepage "Start here": the three ways to begin. No prices on the homepage (owner, 26 Nov 2026);
// prices live on /website-audit/ and /pricing/.
---
<section aria-labelledby="start-heading" class="bg-[var(--bg)] py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--accent)]">Start here</p>
    <h2 id="start-heading" class="mt-2 text-center font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] sm:text-4xl">Three ways to begin, all online.</h2>

    <ul class="mt-9 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3" role="list">
      <li>
        <a href="/website-audit/" class="start start-a flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl p-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] opacity-80">Website audit</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold">See what to fix first</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-90">Enquiry journeys, search visibility, speed, mobile and public security signals, reviewed by a person, with prioritised fixes.</span>
          <span class="mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold">Book an audit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pricing/#booking-advance" class="start start-b flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl p-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] opacity-80">Book a project</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold">Reserve your project slot</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-90">Pay a secure booking advance online to reserve a discovery session and a place in our schedule.</span>
          <span class="mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold">Pay booking advance <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/get-quote/" class="start start-c flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-6 text-[var(--text)]">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Get a quote</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold">Tell us what you need</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-dim)]">We review quote requests within one business day and reply with the scope and next steps.</span>
          <span class="mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold text-[var(--accent)]">Request a quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-5 text-center text-sm text-[var(--text-dim)]">Accessibility audits and website packages: see <a href="/pricing/" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">pricing</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .start { transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .start:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .start-a { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #047857, #065f46); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -26px rgba(4,120,87,.9); }
  .start-b { color: #fff; background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 100% 0%, #a78bfa 0%, transparent 55%), linear-gradient(150deg, #4f46e5, #312e81); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -26px rgba(79,70,229,.9); }
  .start-c:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .start:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #6366f1; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
